    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ART IS RIFLE is an open-world, FPS puzzle game with rhythmic bullets and psychedelic art styles. Powered by Unreal Engine 5 and much passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PSYCHEDELIC REINVENTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a psychedelic adventure through first-of-its-kind mind altering core gameplay mechanics, beyond visual and auditory designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/a9a7871dec4f564dec885d4452e217a8.poster.avif?t=1754409064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/a9a7871dec4f564dec885d4452e217a8.webm?t=1754409064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/a9a7871dec4f564dec885d4452e217a8.mp4?t=1754409064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world of puzzles where tutorials are optional, and discovery is key! Puzzles are your canvas, solve them your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A work of art is a puzzle; when solved, it exposes the hidden layers of meaning and symbolism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MUSIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole world is your drum kit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a visually striking game that dances with a fusion of intense colors and mind-altering, psychedelic elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/301063838a3b7a2d4c132d31c3273812.poster.avif?t=1754409064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/301063838a3b7a2d4c132d31c3273812.webm?t=1754409064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/301063838a3b7a2d4c132d31c3273812.mp4?t=1754409064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ART IS RIFLE is an open-world, FPS puzzle game with rhythmic bullets and psychedelic art styles. Powered by Unreal Engine 5 and much passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PSYCHEDELIC REINVENTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a psychedelic adventure through first-of-its-kind mind altering core gameplay mechanics, beyond visual and auditory designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/a9a7871dec4f564dec885d4452e217a8.poster.avif?t=1754409064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/a9a7871dec4f564dec885d4452e217a8.webm?t=1754409064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/a9a7871dec4f564dec885d4452e217a8.mp4?t=1754409064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world of puzzles where tutorials are optional, and discovery is key! Puzzles are your canvas, solve them your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A work of art is a puzzle; when solved, it exposes the hidden layers of meaning and symbolism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MUSIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole world is your drum kit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a visually striking game that dances with a fusion of intense colors and mind-altering, psychedelic elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/301063838a3b7a2d4c132d31c3273812.poster.avif?t=1754409064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/301063838a3b7a2d4c132d31c3273812.webm?t=1754409064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/301063838a3b7a2d4c132d31c3273812.mp4?t=1754409064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
